#$#	P-CAD Gerber Aperture Table Version 2.0 (Do not change this line.)

# SQUARE has 'Outside Width' only.
# POLYGON can have 3 to 10 sides and irregular shape.
# TARGET & THERMAL use 'Outside Diameter' only, have generic looks in CARDS.
# THERMAL has inner & outer diameters, tie count & width, and starting angle.
# SPECIAL shape may have round/rectangular bounding circle/box, or neither.
# 'Outside Diameter' applies to ROUND, TARGET, THERMAL and SPECIAL.
# 'Outside Width and  Height' apply to shapes of OVAL, RECTANGLE and SPECIAL.
# 'Sides' applies to POLYGON only.
# 'Inside Width & Height(Diameter)' apply to inner rectangular(round) hole.
# 'Rotation' applies to SQUARE, RECTANGLE and OVAL only.
# 'LINE' applies only to rounds and squares - without hole and rotation
# TARGET & SPECIAL can have a 'Comment' field.

UNIT = ENGLISH (inch)

